| Setting | Value | Where |
|---|---|---|
| `iosVersion` | `15.0` | [ios/Flutter/ephemeral/Packages/FlutterGeneratedPluginSwiftPackage/Package.swift:12](../../ios/Flutter/ephemeral/Packages/FlutterGeneratedPluginSwiftPackage/Package.swift#L12) |
